carries a small raised letter tag, and its target shows a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]matching `↩ p. N` return pill that jumps back to the passage the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]reader left. Link targets resolve robustly, dead links are visible [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]instead of silent, and the tags and pills never leak into [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]highlights synced into the vault.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ref_create_return_links.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/ref_create_return_links.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-5j[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-5j/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render paired return links in Markdown PDFs[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: add a second pandoc Lua filter plus TeX macros that resolve, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tag, and pair every eligible same-document link with a return-pill row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]at its target, unify the link ink, report pairing counts and dead-link [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]warnings from bob, and cover it with filter, XeLaTeX, and CLI tests plus[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Keep return-link glyphs out of synced highlights[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]export[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]export: stamp a `return_links: true` marker key on PDFs that actually [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]carry return links, register it as a standard synced field, and strip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tag glyphs and pill text from highlight text when `bob ref sync` renders[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the note region for those PDFs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-5j","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-5j.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-69e1d6b1e8a3ed6d18ffbe5e7c019516","started_at":"2026-10-07T18:46:52.574844+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"8a13b70d29242b70db015f2cef79206de1a816a394582f07789cb17928a12b4c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5j.land--gate/chat.md","size_bytes":556},"commits":{"digest":"96b633b7450aacad7dc63c58bc8f98e3a8f985fd5c5c92980326a8696eae65f8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5j.land--gate/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"4659defb14d14320054a5ff6f7156f005f87a64191de8738b1316ac2913d0657","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5j.land--gate/meta.json","size_bytes":752},"state":{"digest":"9ec832fe7afd275abb2879bd563098fde01d8463357e5fa8a1a0e002f61d51d0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5j.land--gate/state.json","size_bytes":210}},"finished_at":"2026-10-07T20:32:36.308278+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5j.land--gate","local_name":"bob-cli-5j.land--gate","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-5j","agent_clan_generation":"20261007142854","agent_session":"bob-cli-5j.land","agent_session_role":"gate","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-5j","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-5j","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"ga